program	errors/optional_move_unwrap_field.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot move out of field `r` of `h`
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot move out of field `r` of `h`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/optional_move_unwrap_field.saw:19:13"
log	"     |"
log	" 19 |     let g = move h.r!"
log	"     |             ^"
log	"   hint: `move` at an optional projection retires the whole BINDING, which a field cannot do; use `h.r.take()` to move the payload out and leave `None` behind"
log	""
log	"error: undefined variable `g`"
log	"  --> examples/errors/optional_move_unwrap_field.saw:20:15"
log	"     |"
log	" 20 |     print(\"g {g.id}\")"
log	"     |               ^"
log	""
log	"2 error(s) generated"
